Subject: [PATCH 0919/1053] feat: Add button ratio slider

---
 src/gfx.cpp                          |  7 ++-
 src/settings_gui.cpp                 | 73 +++++++++++++++++-----------
 src/table/settings/misc_settings.ini |  9 ++++
